%%MatrixMarket matrix coordinate real symmetric
% Tiny SPD test fixture for the Matrix Market loader (issue #27).
% 4x4 tridiagonal, diagonal 4, off-diagonal -1 (= 4I - tridiag(1,0,1)):
% symmetric positive definite, so GS/SOR converge and the CG reference is valid.
% Symmetric storage (lower triangle only); mm_read expands to 10 full nonzeros.
4 4 7
1 1 4
2 1 -1
2 2 4
3 2 -1
3 3 4
4 3 -1
4 4 4
